        "alt_text": "gameplay screenshot showing the crossword partially filled in\n\nthe status at the bottom can be seen saying:\nacross (green)\nexpect: cw==\nactual: cw==\ndown (red)\nexpect: -Infinity\nerror: SyntaxError: Unexpected end of input",
